#reason package.json Public repository needs repository, homepage, bugs and the current description.
#reason test/auth-accounts.test.ts Unauthorized-token case is built at run time instead of a literal.
#reason test/auth-ipc-tokens.test.ts Unknown-token case is built at run time instead of a literal.
#reason test/auth-redact.test.ts Redaction cases keep real token shapes without a scannable literal.
#reason test/e2e/integrations.spec.ts E2E account tokens are built at run time, same values as before.
#reason test/helpers/fake-tokens.ts One place builds token-shaped test values from parts at run time.
#reason test/helpers/host-world.ts Shared Bitbucket token is built at run time.
#reason test/integration-skills-bitbucket.test.ts Skill test token is built at run time.
#reason test/integration-skills-conventions.test.ts Per-skill credentials are built at run time.
#reason test/integration-skills-github.test.ts Skill test fine-grained token is built at run time.
#reason test/integration-skills-jira.test.ts Skill test Atlassian token is built at run time.
#reason test/integration-skills-standalone.test.ts Injected tokens for the three skills are built at run time.
#reason test/integrations-screen.test.ts Second and unknown GitHub tokens are built at run time.
#reason test/lantern-host-github.test.ts Bitbucket account token is built at run time.
#reason test/lantern-host-status.test.ts Account token is built once at run time and reused in the assertion.
#story Making the repository public
#step actor Maintainer
#file package.json
#step action switches the repository to public
#step subject package metadata and test sources
#file test/helpers/fake-tokens.ts
#file test/auth-redact.test.ts
